error[E_AMBIGUOUS_OPERATORS]: `+` and `&` cannot be mixed without parentheses
 --> 2:39
  |
2 |     permission view = a1x + b1x + c1x & d1x & e1x - f1x
  |                                       ^
  |
  = help: add parentheses to say which grouping you mean, either
              (a1x + b1x + c1x) & d1x & e1x ...
          or
              a1x + b1x + (c1x & d1x & e1x) ...
